olid var(--mist-200);border-radius:6px;background:var(--mist-50)\">15 mm</span><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:12px;padding:3px 8px;border:1px solid var(--mist-200);border-radius:6px;background:var(--mist-50)\">EIS</span></div><div style=\"margin-top:6px\"><a class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-sm btn-full\" href=\"/products/rix-pocket-k3-384x288-termisk-monokikare-med-bildstabilisering\">Se produkten</a></div></div></article><article class=\"h3\" style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--mist-200);border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;display:flex;flex-direction:column;transition:transform 120ms,box-shadow 120ms\"><div style=\"aspect-ratio:4/3;background:var(--mist-50);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:16px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0949/6553/0964/files/PIX-PFI-M425___Pixfra-Mile-2-M425-Thermal-Imaging-Monocular.png?v=1766943659&width=600\" alt=\"PixFra Mile M2 384×288 25 mm värmekikare\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"450\" style=\"max-width:100%;max-height:100%;width:auto;height:auto;object-fit:contain\"></div><div style=\"padding:18px 20px 20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;flex:1\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--text-muted)\">PixFra · Allround</span><h3 style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:700\">Mile M2 384×288 25 mm</h3><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;flex:1\">384-sensor, 25 mm f/1.0, OLED 800×600, 320 g och IP67. Det mesta av mellanklassen till instegspris.</p><div style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:12px;padding:3px 8px;border:1px solid var(--mist-200);border-radius:6px;background:var(--mist-50)\">384×288</span><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:12px;padding:3px 8px;border:1px solid var(--mist-200);border-radius:6px;background:var(--mist-50)\">25 mm</span><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:12px;padding:3px 8px;border:1px solid var(--mist-200);border-radius:6px;background:var(--mist-50)\">≤25 mK</span></div><div style=\"margin-top:6px\"><a class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-sm btn-full\" href=\"/products/pixfra-mile-m2-384x288-25-mm-varmekamera\">Se produkten</a></div></div></article></div></section><section id=\"10-20\" style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px\"><h2 style=\"font-size:28px;font-weight:800\">10 000–20 000 kr: allroundklassen</h2><p>Här hamnar de flesta som jagar både skog och fält. 384 med 25–35 mm eller 640 med 25 mm, OLED-display, ofta bytbart 18650- eller APS-batteri och NETD runt 15–25 mK. Skillnaden mot klassen under är detalj på håll, lugnare bild och batteri som går att byta i mörkret.</p><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(260px,1fr));gap:20px\"><article class=\"h3\" style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--mist-200);border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;display:flex;flex-direction:column;transition:transform 120ms,box-shadow 120ms\"><div style=\"aspect-ratio:4/3;background:var(--mist-50);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:16px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0949/6553/0964/files/Axion_XQ19_Compact_0001_d7b2d958-7163-4f11-b809-73eb9cd9cd40.webp?v=1766941790&width=600\" alt=\"Pulsar Axion XQ19 Compact värmekamera\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"450\" style=\"max-width:100%;max-height:100%;width:auto;height:auto;object-fit:contain\"></div><div style=\"padding:18px 20px 20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;flex:1\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--text-muted)\">Pulsar · Kompakt allround</span><h3 style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:700\">Axion XQ19 Compact</h3><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;flex:1\">384×288 (17 µm), 19 mm f/1.0, 19,5° synfält, AMOLED, APS3-batteri och IPX7. Pulsars minsta, med Stream Vision 2.</p><div style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:12px;padding:3px 8px;border:1px solid var(--mist-200);border-radius:6px;background:var(--mist-50)\">384×288</span><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:12px;padding:3px 8px;border:1px solid var(--mist-200);border-radius:6px;background:var(--mist-50)\">19 mm</span><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:12px;padding:3px 8px;border:1px solid var(--mist-200);border-radius:6px;background:var(--mist-50)\">&lt;18 mK</span></div><div style=\"margin-top:6px\"><a class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-sm btn-full\" href=\"/products/pulsar-axion-xq19-compact-384x288-varmekamera\">Se produkten</a></div></div></article><article class=\"h3\" style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--mist-200);border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;display:flex;flex-direction:column;transition:transform 120ms,box-shadow 120ms\"><div style=\"aspect-ratio:4/3;background:var(--mist-50);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:16px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0949/6553/0964/files/800q-01_134887.png?v=1766941202&width=600\" alt=\"HIKMICRO Lynx LH25 3.0 termisk monokikare\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"450\" style=\"max-width:100%;max-height:100%;width:auto;height:auto;object-fit:contain\"></div><div style=\"padding:18px 20px 20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;flex:1\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--text-muted)\">HIKMICRO · Allround 384</span><h3 style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:700\">Lynx LH25 3.0</h3><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;flex:1\">384×288 på 12 µm, 25 mm f/1.0, NETD &lt;15 mK, 1920×1080 AMOLED och slutarfri drift. Bytbart 18650.</p><div style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:12px;padding:3px 8px;borde